# Use-case 02 gap 3, second half (claim C2): a &: spread applied to
# pack()-GENERATED children yields a contribution with NO source
# location -- printed as "*4|integer  (spread)" with an empty site.
#   aontu why '$.deploy.web.replicas' spread-site-empty.aon
# On a plain (non-pack) map the same spread carries its real site
# (see sibling-split.aon), and reference-api.md promises "the site
# each contribution was written at".
# expected: 1. *4|integer  spread-site-empty.aon:13:24  (spread)
# actual:   1. *4|integer  (spread)        -- file/row/col empty
#           (JSON record: site {file:"", row:-1, col:-1, len:-1})
tbl: hide({ web: {}, api: {} })
deploy: pack($.tbl, { svc: key() })
deploy: &: { replicas: *4 | integer }
deploy: api: replicas: 12
